{"id":"lele-6","title":"202206 青少年软件编程等级考试Scratch二级真题","subject":"scratch","subjectName":"电子学会Scratch","level":2,"yearmonth":"202206","year":"2022","count":37,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色初始位置如图所示，下面哪个选项能让角色移到舞台的左下角？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648637066268.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648637256397.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648637381843.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648637508464.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648637613576.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"舞台的左下角，坐标x为负数，坐标y为负数，故应该使用移到x:-100 y:-100，故答案选C。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"点击绿旗，执行下面程序，关于小鱼的运动描述正确的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648642211771.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648642359376.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：小鱼不会动。"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：小鱼一会儿向上游，一会儿向下游。"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：按下空格键小鱼向上游，松开空格键小鱼就不动。"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：按下空格键小鱼往前游，松开空格键小鱼往后退。"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"小鱼面向方向90°为向右，如果按下空格键，那么小鱼往前游，每次移动10步；否则就往后退，每次移动1步。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"做一个赛车游戏，车的初始方向面向右，车的左边是蓝色赛道，右边是红色赛道，以下哪个选项能实现赛车始终在赛道内前进？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648644227651.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648644407559.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648644535224.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648644664794.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648644789154.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"AD选项赛车在赛道并没有碰到舞台边缘，无法实现题意要求。B选项赛车碰到左边蓝色向右转，右边红色向左转可以实现题目要求。C选项赛车碰到蓝色向左转，碰到红色向右转，与题意不符。故选B","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"观察下列图形变换规律，问号处的图形应该是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648646031036.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648646244189.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648646377912.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648646504966.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648646634674.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":null,"auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"女孩程序和位置如下图所示，点击一次女孩后等待程序执行完毕，再点击一次女孩，说法正确的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648647457877.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648647658316.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：第二次点击女孩，女孩说“我的宠物不是鸭子”。"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：第二次点击女孩，女孩从鸭子处移动到Dog1的位置。"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：第二次点击女孩，女孩说“找到我的宠物了！”。"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：第一次点击女孩，女孩移到鸭子的位置。"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"第一次点击女孩，女孩会说“我的宠物不是鸭子”，移到Dog1的位置；第二次点击女孩，女孩会说“找到我的宠物了！”。故答案选C。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色列表区如下图所示，舞台上角色显示正确的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648649515757.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648649713186.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648649952517.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648650098881.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648650226273.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648650349602.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"Abby角色的状态为隐藏，Avery角色的状态为显示，所以舞台区只能看见Avery，看不见Abby，故答案选C。","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"舞台上，气球角色挡住了小猫角色，要想把气球放在小猫角色的后面，小猫角色执行下面哪个积木可以实现？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648653367181.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648653539714.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648653684447.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648653813087.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648654106660.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"现在是小猫角色在气球角色的后面，要想把气球角色放在小猫角色的后面，对小猫角色运行【移到最前面】语句就可以了，故答案选A。","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"执行下面程序，角色会在舞台区画出什么图案？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648656363099.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：边长为120 的三角形"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：边长为120的正方形"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：边长为80的三角形"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：边长为80的正方形"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"角色第一次向前移动80步后，右转120度，继续画第二条边，右转120度后，画第三条边，第四次重复执行是在第1条边上重画一次，由于三角形的外角为120度，所以最终画出一个边长为80的三角形。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"默认小猫角色，执行下面程序后，舞台上可以看到几只小猫？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648658191485.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：0"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：2"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：3"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：4"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"小猫本体隐藏，盖下第1个图章，移动100步，盖下第2个图章，移动100步，盖下第3个图章，移动100步；所以舞台上会有3只小猫。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下面哪个选项，可以实现按下键盘上的右键，角色向右移动？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648659381272.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648659521112.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648659655216.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648659786148.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"要实现按下右键，角色就向右移动，X坐标应该增加一个正数，故B、C、D错误。","auto":true},{"no":11,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"对下面积木描述正确的选项是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648835088093.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：如果①处条件为真，重复执行②处的指令。"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：如果①处条件为假，执行②处的指令。"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：如果①处条件为真，执行②处的指令。"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：如果①处条件为假，重复执行②处的指令。"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"题目中的指令为判断语句①处为判断条件，只有当条件成立，即为“真”的时候，才会执行②处的指令。","auto":true},{"no":12,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"点击绿旗执行下面程序，下面选项描述正确的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648836457347.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：按下空格后，角色一直移动，直到移动到舞台中心后停止移动。"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：角色一直移动，当按下空格键后，角色移动到舞台中心后停止移动。"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：角色一直移动，当按下空格键后，角色立即停止移动。"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：角色移动到舞台中心，按下空格键后一直移动。"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"当绿旗被点击，开始执行重复执行直到积木，此时会一直重复执行移动10步和碰到边缘就反弹，当按下空格键时，退出循环，继续向下执行移到X:0,Y:0，角色回到舞台中心。","auto":true},{"no":13,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色ben共有4个造型，程序执行前是第一个造型，点击一次绿旗，角色的造型最终停留在？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648838489537.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：ben-a"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：ben-b"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：ben-c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：ben-d"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"当绿旗被点击，角色切换到ben-a造型，然后重复执行下一个造型10次，最简单的方法就是挨个造型数，数到10的那个造型就是角色最后的造型，这里是ben-c造型。","auto":true},{"no":14,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"右图的程序运行后，绘制的图案如左图所示，下面选项中红点表示角色的中心点，中心点位置正确的选项是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648842098925.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648842306662.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648842518999.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648842692763.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648842952446.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648843092280.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"从题目中的代码知道，最终图案是由单个椭圆形旋转而成的，从最终图案的构成分析，整个图形的中心就是椭圆的旋转中心，与之最接近的选项就是C。","auto":true},{"no":15,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"执行下面程序，角色的y坐标最终为？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648845062400.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：0"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：50"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：-50"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：100"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"角色的初始坐标是（0，0），重复执行10次将y坐标增加5，角色最终的y坐标是0+10*5=50。","auto":true},{"no":16,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"红框中填入哪个选项，可以实现：如果碰到“Bug 族小兵”或者“Bug 族头目”，角色说“救命！”2秒？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648846758242.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648846961814.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648847158432.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648847282741.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648847438232.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"碰到Bug 族小兵和碰到Bug 族头目这两个条件只要有一个成立，就喊出“救命！”，所以这里需要填写的判断条件需要用“或”来连接。","auto":true},{"no":17,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下面两段程序可以合并成哪个选项，合并前和合并后实现的功能相同？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648849398554.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648849947102.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648850085494.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648850227334.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648850375977.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"B选项和合并前的两段程序都能实现，按下左键，向左移动，按下右键，向右移动。","auto":true},{"no":18,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下面三张图分别为舞台、笔的中心点、笔的程序，程序中的红色与舞台上的红色一致，点击绿旗，下面选项说法正确的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648851578289.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648851728598.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648851848323.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：鼠标点击红色，画笔的颜色会设为红色。"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：按下鼠标，舞台区会变成红色。"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：只要角色笔碰到红色，画笔的颜色就会设为红色。"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：鼠标点击红色，舞台区会变成红色。"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"按下鼠标且碰到红色，就把画笔的颜色设为红色。A选项正确。","auto":true},{"no":19,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"雪人和小猫的初始位置如左图所示，雪人面向90方向，程序如右图所示，点击绿旗，下面选项说法错误的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648854752075.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648854891894.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：雪人到小猫的距离小于50时，说“你好！”。"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：雪人到小猫的距离大于50时，一直移动。"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：雪人到小猫的距离大于50时，说“你好！”。"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：雪人到小猫的距离小于50时，不再移动。"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"当雪人与小猫的距离大于或等于50时，雪人一直执行移动10步，当与小猫的距离小于50时，退出循环，说“你好！”。","auto":true},{"no":20,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"关于下面程序，说法正确的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648856099349.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：角色只能同时碰到黑色、白色、红色，才会向右旋转。"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：角色碰到黑色、白色、红色其中一种颜色，就会向右旋转。"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：角色只能同时碰到黑色、白色、红色，才会向左旋转。"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：角色碰到黑色、白色、红色其中一种颜色，就会向左旋转。"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"判断条件部分是两个“或”语句，因此三个条件只要一个成立，条件就满足，排除 A、C 选项；条件成立部分是向右旋转，排除 C、D 选项。因此 B 选项正确。","auto":true},{"no":21,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列选项中，与下图程序的判断结果相同的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648857697679.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648857885604.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648858023940.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648858168686.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648858301883.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"题干中的语句判断结果为\"ture\"，四个选项中，只有C选项判断结果为\"true\"，其他皆为\"flase\"。","auto":true},{"no":22,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"当绿旗点击时，角色会说出什么内容？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648859405450.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：1"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：2"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：3"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：12"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"连接的功能是将左右两边的内容连接成一个内容，可以是数字，也可以是文字，所以说出的结果应该是12，选项D正确。","auto":true},{"no":23,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色的坐标为（-100，90），初始方向为90，当执行下面积木后，角色的坐标变为多少？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648860288963.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：（-200，90）"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：（0，90）"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：（-100，-10）"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：（-100，190）"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"角色面向90方向，所以移动100步，x坐标会增加100，角色位置变成（0，90）。","auto":true},{"no":24,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"执行下面程序后，最后角色的坐标是多少？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648861417153.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：（0，10）"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：（100，100）"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：（200，100）"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：（100，200）"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"这个程序是一个顺序结构的程序，它会按顺序一条一条执行。所以角色从起始位置出发后，面向 0 度方向，移动 10 步，然后移到坐标为(100,0)的位置，再向右旋转 90 度，将 x 坐标增加 100，y 坐标增加 100，最终坐标为(200,100)。","auto":true},{"no":25,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"执行下面程序，角色一共会移动多少步？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648862589869.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：10"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：20"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：30"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：60"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"移动的步数为6x10=60步。","auto":true},{"no":1,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"左边流程图可以用右边积木来实现。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648863576284.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648863746281.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"观察所给流程图，共有两次条件判断，而题干中给出的积木只能进行一次判断，所以积木和流程图不符，应该用下面这组积木实现。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"点击绿旗后，按下十次空格键，小猫的y坐标变为100。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648865422635.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"按下空格键后，小猫会先向上移动后，松开空格键又回到舞台中心(0,0)位置。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"执行下面积木，角色会消失。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648866486475.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"将角色的虚像效果设为100后，角色将会变成透明状态，所以舞台区将看不到这个角色。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"点击屏幕左下角的“添加扩展”后，再点击“画笔”，可以添加画笔的所有积木。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648867808356.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648868016455.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"【画笔】模块在添加拓展区域中","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"执行下面程序，角色会在舞台上一直四处移动，碰到边缘反弹。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648869363631.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"当绿旗被点击，角色移动10步后停止，不会持续四处移动，需要添加重复执行语句，角色才会实现题干中的效果。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"下面两段程序实现的功能一样，角色碰到“怪兽”后，说“失败”2秒，整个程序结束。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648870102622.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"两段程序实现的功能一样。","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"下面积木可以修改画笔的颜色。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648871188813.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"侦测模块中的碰到颜色积木，可以检测角色有没有碰到颜色，不能改变画笔颜色。","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"判断两个条件是否同时满足，可以使用下面这个积木。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648872052851.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"判断两个条件同时满足，要用到与积木，或积木用来判断两个条件是否满足任意一个。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"执行下面程序，角色说“你好！”。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648872806680.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"因为4>3条件成立，成立条件的不成立为不成立，所以不会说你好。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"执行左边程序，可以画出右边图形。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648873794819.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648873958664.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"如图程序才能画出正确的图形，框出的地方需要重复执行 180 次才能画出完整的圆。","auto":true},{"no":1,"type":"问答题","stem":[{"t":"画正方形"},{"t":"在舞台正中央绘制一个边长为200的正方形。"},{"t":"1.准备工作"},{"t":"（1）保留默认小猫角色并隐藏角色；"},{"t":"（2）默认空白背景；"},{"t":"（3）添加画笔模块。"},{"t":"2.功能实现"},{"t":"（1）画笔颜色设为黑色，画笔粗细设为4；"},{"t":"（2）围绕舞台中心绘制正方形，正方形的中心点坐标为（0,0）；"},{"t":"（3）正方形的边长为200。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648875601345.png"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"评分标准： （1）画笔颜色设为黑色，画笔粗细设为4；（4分） （2）能绘制出一个正方形；（4分） （3）正方形边长为200；（2分） （4）正方形起点坐标正确，正方形中心在舞台中心。（5分）","auto":false},{"no":2,"type":"问答题","stem":[{"t":"大鱼吃小鱼"},{"t":"在浩瀚的大海中，有一条大鲨鱼，它正张着大嘴肆意地捕食着弱小的鱼群。"},{"t":"1.准备工作"},{"t":"（1）选择背景Underwater1；"},{"t":"（2）删除默认小猫角色，选择角色Shark2和角色Fish。"},{"t":"2.功能实现"},{"t":"（1）当按下“上键”或“下键”时，Shark2可以上下移动；当按下“左键”或“右键”时，Shark2可以左右移动；"},{"t":"（2）按下“左键”，Shark2面向左，按下“右键”，Shark2面向右；按下“上键”和“下键”，Shark2的方向不变化；"},{"t":"（3）点击绿旗，Fish出现在随机位置；"},{"t":"（4）当Shark2碰到Fish时，会张嘴闭嘴一次，这时Fish会隐藏被”吃掉“，一秒后Fish会重新在随机位置出现。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221004/16648877042239.png"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"评分标准： （1）当按下“上键”或“下键”时，Shark2可以上下移动；当按下“左键”或“右键”时，Shark2可以左右移动；（4分） （2）Shark2的面向方向会跟着左右键方向变化；（2分） （3）程序运行时，Fish会在随机位置出现；（3分） （4）当Shark2碰到Fish时，会张闭嘴一次，这时Fish会隐藏，一秒后Fish会重新在随机位置出现。（6分）","auto":false}],"durationMin":60,"totalScore":100,"passScore":60,"source":"leledati","tags":{"year":"2022","type":"真题","progress":"未开始"}}